  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PDF → JSON\nЕдиное распознавание для **UI** и **Telegram**.\nВызов идёт из **lab-api** (`/api/analyze` / `analyze-sync`) → этот webhook → Gemini → JSON.\nШаги `Шаг: …` пишут прогресс в lab-api (`/api/jobs/:id/step`).",
        "height": 284,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000100",
      "name": "Note: обзор",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -384,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Webhook\nВход от **lab-api** (канал UI или Telegram — уже выбран снаружи).\n**POST** binary PDF + `jobId`. Ответ — нода **Ответ**.",
        "height": 266,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Note: Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -16,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lab-pdf-analyze",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "binaryPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "lab-pdf-analyze",
      "notes": "Вход: PDF + jobId от lab-api (UI или Telegram). Path: lab-pdf-analyze"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Подготовить PDF\nДостаёт PDF из binary → **base64**, имя файла, sizeMb, `host` Docker→хост.",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Note: Подготовить PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        224,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = items[0];\nconst binary = item.binary || {};\nconst binaryKey = Object.keys(binary).find((k) => {\n  const b = binary[k] || {};\n  return (b.mimeType || '').includes('pdf') || /\\.pdf$/i.test(b.fileName || '') || /data|file|pdf/i.test(k);\n}) || Object.keys(binary)[0];\nif (!binaryKey) throw new Error('PDF не найден');\nconst meta = binary[binaryKey];\nconst buffer = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, binaryKey);\nconst jobId = item.json.jobId || '';\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    jobId,\n    fileName: meta.fileName || 'document.pdf',\n    sizeMb: Number((buffer.length / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(2)),\n    pdfBase64: buffer.toString('base64'),\n    host: 'http://host.docker.internal:8787',\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Подготовить PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Binary PDF → base64 + meta + host.docker.internal:8787"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Шаг: prepare done\nПрогресс в lab-api: подготовка PDF готова (`n8n_prepare`).\n`continueOnFail` — сбой шага не рвёт пайплайн.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Note: prepare done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        464,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.host }}/api/jobs/{{ $json.jobId }}/step",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ id: 'n8n_prepare', status: 'done', detail: 'PDF подготовлен' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Шаг: prepare done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "SSE/прогресс: n8n_prepare = done"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Шаг: gemini running\nПрогресс: «идёт запрос к Gemini» (`n8n_gemini` running).",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Note: gemini running",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        688,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.host }}/api/jobs/{{ $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.jobId }}/step",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ id: 'n8n_gemini', status: 'running', detail: 'Запрос к Gemini' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Шаг: gemini running",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        704,
        0
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "SSE/прогресс: n8n_gemini = running"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Gemini на хосте\nГлавный вызов: `POST /api/internal/gemini`.\nPDF → структурированный **analysis** JSON (таймаут до 5 мин).",
        "height": 180,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000105",
      "name": "Note: Gemini",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        912,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.host }}/api/internal/gemini",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ pdfBase64: $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.pdfBase64, fileName: $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.fileName, jobId: $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.jobId }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Gemini на хосте",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        928,
        0
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "Host Gemini: PDF → analysis JSON"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Шаг: assemble\nПрогресс: «сборка ответа» (`n8n_assemble` running).",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000106",
      "name": "Note: assemble",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.host }}/api/jobs/{{ $('Подготовить PDF').item.json.jobId }}/step",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ id: 'n8n_assemble', status: 'running', detail: 'Сборка ответа' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Шаг: assemble",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1152,
        0
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "notes": "SSE/прогресс: n8n_assemble = running"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Собрать ответ\nНормализует ответ Gemini в `{ ok, analysis }` или `{ ok:false, error }` для lab-api.",
        "width": 220,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000107",
      "name": "Note: Собрать ответ",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1344,
        -224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const prev = $('Подготовить PDF').first().json;\nconst res = $('Gemini на хосте').first().json;\nif (res.ok && res.analysis) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: true, fileName: res.fileName || prev.fileName, sizeMb: res.sizeMb || prev.sizeMb, model: res.model, analysis: res.analysis, via: 'n8n->host-gemini' } }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, error: res.error || res.message || JSON.stringify(res).slice(0,400), fileName: prev.fileName } }];"
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Собрать ответ",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "ok+analysis или error для webhook response"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Шаг: assemble done\nПрогресс: сборка завершена (`n8n_assemble` done).",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b2000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000108",
      "name": "Note: assemble done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
